  "subdivision_of_building": "The proposal is specific to the material change of the timber projects to the rear and side elevation.",
  "status": "Approved",
  "description": "The proposed works involve the removal and replacement of existing timber cladding and associated components on the building’s external timber projections. This intervention is driven by the need to enhance fire safety performance while preserving the architectural character and visual integrity of the façade.\nCladding Replacement\n•\tThe existing timber cladding will be carefully removed and replaced with Rockpanel Woods (Ebony), a non-combustible material selected for its close resemblance to the weathered timber currently in place.\n•\tThe new cladding system will achieve a minimum fire classification of A2-s1, d0, in accordance with BS EN 13501-1, ensuring compliance with modern fire safety standards without compromising the building’s aesthetic.\nCarrier System and Insulation Replacement\n•\tThe underlying timber carrier framework and insulation—both of which are combustible—will be fully removed.\n•\tThese will be replaced with a non-combustible support system and insulation materials that also meet or exceed Class A2-s1, d0 fire performance, contributing to a safer and more resilient building envelope.\nCavity Barriers\n•\tCavity barriers will be installed within the rainscreen system in accordance with Approved Document B of the Building Regulations and the recommendations of the appointed Fire Engineer.\n",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "<p>The development hereby permitted must be begun not later than the expiration of three years beginning with the date of this permission.</p><p><br></p><p>\r\n</p><p>\r\nREASON: In order to comply with the provisions of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 (as amended).</p><p>\r\n</p>",
    "<p>The Development hereby permitted shall only be carried out and completed strictly in accordance with the submitted plans hereby approved and any subsequent approval of details.\r\n</p><p><br></p><p>\r\nREASON: To ensure that the development hereby permitted is carried out in full accordance with the plans hereby approved.\r\n</p>"
